    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de6d85cc48950ddc9fc67410",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为什——么，我会被神业甩了啊！？\n明明是那孩子的擅长领域的话，我也能帮她打磨的！可是――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d534ec61aa8ec23b2c1b585c04c80c68303bdefac1b74960146edbb76d38d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
