      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘛，这是神业做出的判断。……呐，训练员君？\n你有我们所没有的，能让她获胜的方案吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f573672c557a5415df6fdfa255d4b524e5feaf3013291205a35d414e5d1dd6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
